              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Connie Lamoureux"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It tastes great, but if you double the recipe, and use regular long grain rice, expect it to take a LOT longer, and use about twice as much liquid as the recipe calls for. Still is a great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2022-05-05T02:44:39.887Z"
          },
          {
