            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mowseymouse"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This turned out so much better than I thought with instant rice. Very easy and simple recipe that you can add anything to, and it would still taste great. I am at a high altitude so I did add a little extra chicken broth and let it cook a little longer and I added some green chilis. Excellent!",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-20T08:01:09.707Z"
